  <ThingDef ParentName="FH_BaseFleshBeast">
    <defName>FH_Nexusmeld</defName>
    <label>nexusmeld</label>
    <description>A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. The nexusmeld is the core of the fleshbeast swarm's coordination, using its powerful psychic abilities to command other fleshbeasts in assaults. Nexusmelds rarely appear in raids, preferring to lurk within nests supported by fleshmass hearts, with which they share a psychic bond.</description>
